# Frame pacing of a drag, on the replay brain: the explorable's slider moves a bound picture (a sun along its sky, a shadow, a line of words), dragged both ways at a
# steady pace. `pnpm record --journey drag` says how many distinct pictures a second a viewer gets while the knob moves, and the page's own frames in journey.json.
type | explorable
rest
hold 1
drag height 10 > 80 over=4
hold 1
drag height 80 > 10 over=4
hold 1
